  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc product-specification-table-small-padding\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Product Specifications</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\">\n<div>Product ID</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>Cable Length</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>Fit for Light Size</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>Material</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>Quantity</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD; text-align: center;\">XC001</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">226mm</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">3pin/10mm</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">Plastic</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">2 pcs</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Instruction</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<ul style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; row-gap: 10px; column-gap: 50px;\">\n<li>\n<p>3 Pin 10mm LED Strip Connector Cable fits <a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/ws2812b-rgb-led-strip-light\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong>WS2812B RGB LED Strip Light,</strong></span></a> perfect DIY led light accessory kit.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Consideration</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<ul style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; row-gap: 10px; column-gap: 50px;\">\n<li>\n<p>Red connected positive pole, black connected negative pole. Make sure the correct connection\"+\" \"-\" mark on the connector before powering on.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Product Feature</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<ul class=\"pct_productFeatureList\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; row-gap: 10px; column-gap: 50px;\">\n<li>\n<p>Quick connect, solderless, easy to install</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Easy to DIY for led light accessory kit</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Good flexibility, easy to bend</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "3 Pin 10mm LED Strip Connector Cable fits WS2812B RGB LED Strip Light, perfect DIY led light accessory kit.\n\nRed connected positive pole, black connected negative pole. Make sure the correct connection\"+\" \"-\" mark on the connector before powering on.\n\nQuick connect, solderless, easy to install\n\nEasy to DIY for led light accessory kit\n\nGood flexibility, easy to bend",
